              "msg": "The save-for-later launch exposed API assumptions; your next design must make the mobile contract explicit.\n\nYou propose a new endpoint for order history. Tom comments: 'Why not reuse GET /orders?' You chose a new one because GET /orders returns full order objects with items, addresses and invoices, and takes 800 ms at p95. The mobile screen needs four fields.",
