            "ctx": "Greg says: 'I don't want a process. I want results.' Write your reply.",
            "opts": [
              {
                "t": "I agree with the goal. The process is only a 15-minute weekly meeting, and it protects results, because it shows what each new request costs before we promise a date to the board.",
                "ok": true,
                "c": "Ставит процесс на службу результату: показывает цену до обещания."
              },
              {
                "t": "Then we'll keep missing deadlines.",
                "ok": false,
                "c": "Упрёк без помощи."
              },
              {
                "t": "Okay, no process. We'll manage it as before.",
                "ok": false,
                "c": "Возврат к хаосу."
              }
            ]
