      "story": [
        {
          "en": "You join Northwind Bank’s app team. Early cases practise evidence, commitments and customer needs, leading to an onboarding investigation with one engineer and a limited budget. Better conversion must still preserve identity checks and customer trust.",
          "ru": "Ты приходишь в app-команду Northwind. Первые кейсы об evidence и promises ведут к onboarding с одним инженером и малым бюджетом. Рост conversion должен сохранить identity checks и trust."
        },
        {
          "en": "The onboarding work exposed the difference between completion and delivered value. As Associate PM you now balance enterprise requests, release readiness and a spending-insights versus accounting-export decision, with the earlier funnel lesson still relevant.",
          "ru": "Onboarding показал различие completion и value. Как Associate PM ты сравниваешь enterprise requests, release readiness и insights с accounting export, используя прежний funnel lesson."
        },
        {
          "en": "The accounting-export pilot created new commitments. You now own an area and must interpret conversion, retention and noisy experiment results, ending with a loan-banner decision where clicks and customer outcomes diverge.",
          "ru": "Export pilot создал обязательства. Ты отвечаешь за area и анализируешь conversion, retention и шумные тесты. Loan banner покажет, почему clicks не равны customer outcomes."
        },
        {
          "en": "The loan-banner readout made proxy metrics insufficient evidence of value. As Senior PM you coordinate cross-team delivery and must choose feasible account-data access and payment-approval commitments, including their privacy and audit obligations.",
          "ru": "Loan-banner readout показал границы proxy metrics. Как Senior PM ты координируешь delivery и выбираешь реальные commitments по API и approvals с privacy и audit obligations."
        },
        {
          "en": "The enterprise work made shared capacity and late requirements visible. You now coach PMs, align roadmaps and address engineering exhaustion; a three-feature promise cannot erase a two-feature sustainable capacity limit.",
          "ru": "Enterprise work выявила общую capacity и поздние требования. Теперь ты развиваешь PM, согласуешь roadmaps и решаешь exhaustion: обещание трёх features не создаёт capacity сверх двух."
        },
        {
          "en": "The exhaustion review linked product planning to human and technical resilience. As Head of Product you turn those lessons into strategy, investment and a staged account-fee decision, where revenue growth and customer loss must be evaluated together.",
          "ru": "Разбор exhaustion связал product planning с устойчивостью. Как Head of Product ты решаешь strategy, investments и staged fees, оценивая revenue и customer loss вместе."
        },
        {
          "en": "The fee rollout left both financial evidence and customer questions. As CPO you explain strategic choices, company economics and a privacy incident, treating uncertainty and retained obligations as part of the strategy rather than a communications inconvenience.",
          "ru": "Fee rollout оставил финансовые результаты и вопросы клиентов. Как CPO ты объясняешь strategy, economics и privacy incident: uncertainty и obligations — часть решения, а не помеха коммуникации."
        }
      ],
